f("DFM-1","core","blocker",["J4","J5"],[],"Core's CONN-TH_XDJK-0271-1650 footprint has only the 3 pin holes and no holes for the jack's 2 locating posts. Lite's copy has NPTH 1.7x2.4 ovals at (+-7.65,+1.60). The courtyards differ too (core x+-8,y-3.45..21.8; Lite x-8.75..12.3,y-4.3..15.2).","Board dump of J4/J5 vs lite J2/J3. Lian Xin drawing A-AV2-7A1 (LCSC C7527522): 3-dia1.6 pin holes plus 2-2X3 post holes; posts 4.5 mm below the base, pins 3.5 mm. With the posts standing on the board the pins can't reach through 1.6 mm.","Use Lite's footprint on core and enlarge the post holes to 2.0x3.0 NPTH slots per the drawing. Re-run courtyard/DRC.","Pins reach -2.9 mm short of the board top (3.5 - 4.5 - 1.6 board), i.e. no engagement")
f("DFM-2","both","major",["J2","J3","J4","J5"],[],"RCA post holes are 1.7x2.4, smaller than the drawing's 2.0x3.0. The footprint's signal pins sit on rows 0.8 mm apart (y -1.95/-1.15); the drawing shows both on one row 8 mm apart.","Drawing A-AV2-7A1. Pin 1.0x0.3 brass (diagonal 1.04) in 1.6 hole = 0.28 mm radial slack against a possible 0.8 mm position error.","Check a real part against a 1:1 print, or buy 2 pcs of C7527522 first. Make the post holes 2.0x3.0. If the pins mismatch, make pins 1/3 plated 1.6x2.4 ovals along y.","Unverified: slack 0.28 mm vs a possible 0.8 mm error")
